 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/match1944221date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞1-1阿森纳 约克雷斯、小蜘蛛均点射 埃泽点球被取消</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260430/zhanbao_image_1944221_1777494784_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260430/zhanbao_image_1944221_1777494784_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260430/zhanbao_image_1944221_1777494784_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>阿尔瓦雷斯、约克雷斯均点射，本·怀特手球送点，VAR取消埃泽点球；双方次回合5月6日移师酋长球场。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/match1784621date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗打进生涯第970球！胜利2-0吉达国民联赛16连胜+多赛1场8分领跑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260430/zhanbao_image_1784621_1777493066_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260430/zhanbao_image_1784621_1777493066_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260430/zhanbao_image_1784621_1777493066_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>C罗头槌打进生涯第970球！科曼破门，利雅得胜利联赛16连胜，多赛1轮8分优势领跑。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f27543eca9bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">埃泽点球被取消，枪手名宿赖特发文怒批：换主队就拿到点球了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.88" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300517298337.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.88" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.88" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300517298337.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300517298337.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠半决赛首回合，阿森纳客场1-1战平马竞。枪手名宿伊恩·赖特社媒发文，怒批裁判取消埃泽点球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f27b578d585native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿尔特塔：埃泽点球被取消有违规则，不理解裁判看了13次后改判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https:/