tio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/69f23ffd36526.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/69f23ffd36526.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/69f23ffd36526.jpg"> </div><p>巴黎官方发布伤情公告，阿什拉夫和舍瓦利耶都将伤缺数周。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f26fed32009native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">吉达国民球迷炫耀球队连续两座亚冠，C罗比手势回应：我有5座欧冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300513329991.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300513329991_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300513329991_720.jpg"> </div><p>沙特联第30轮，利雅得胜利以2-0完胜刚刚拿下亚冠冠军吉达国民。赛后C罗于场边接受媒体采访时遭到挑衅。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f2662788e5anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">沙特联积分榜：利雅得胜利多赛1轮8分领跑，还剩4轮联赛夺冠在望</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300413591297.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.39" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300413591297_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260430/202604300413591297_720.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-29/69f227ee4aee1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">纪录报：穆里尼奥已经下达硬性任务，必须在联赛最后三场取得全胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/69e738baa4d1e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/69e738baa4d1e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/69e738baa4d1e.jpg"> </div><p>据《纪录报》报道，在葡萄牙体育客场1-1意外战平AVS俱乐部赛后，本菲卡主帅穆里尼奥要求球队必须在联赛最后三场取得全胜战绩以争夺联赛第二的位置。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f2318354d07native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：31岁阿克考虑在今夏离开曼城，意甲球队可能再次加入竞争</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240506/6638a53df2e9d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240506/6638a53df2e9d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240506/6638a53df2e9d.jpg"> </div><p>名记罗马诺消息，曼城后卫阿克考虑在今夏离队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f237f17ff2enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西媒：皇马正在筹备请回穆里尼奥执教，阿韦洛亚可能成为他的助教</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260217/6994327ee5d77.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260217/6994327ee5d77.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260217/6994327ee5d77.jpg"> </div><p>据西媒《The Objective》援引皇马内部消息源透露，主席弗洛伦蒂诺正在筹划迎回穆里尼奥，而阿韦洛亚可能成为他的助教。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f24fdf4435cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世体：利雅得新月无意再外租坎塞洛，要么让其回归要么将其出售</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https